      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1gvobk3'
    '|a||Let''s see.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1360
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|a||Most likely it says yes. A yes wins Mia''s gratitude and her bakers'' votes; a no wins nothing, because nobody else noticed.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9160
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|a||Concentrated gain, spread-out cost. Nobody was fooled about the numbers: the knowledge was there, and the incentives pointed the other way.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:175v7r9'
    '|a||Repeat it over a thousand small fees and favours, and a budget can drift a long way from what voters would choose.':
