      ms: 7360
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:8ectjf'
    '|b||And there''s a doubt about the assumption itself. By that sum, hardly anyone should bother to vote. Yet in 2024 nearly two Americans in three did.':
