      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:oxgxn4'
    '|a||So people aren''t pure calculators at the ballot box: some feel a duty, and politicians have convictions too.':
