      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:19aenje'
    '|a||How sure are we? That most voters know little about policy is mostly agreed. How much that bends policy is contested.':
