      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:16hny6a'
    '|b||Buchanan''s own answer wasn''t to give up on government. It was to change its rules, so that the choices that serve voters are also the ones that pay.':
